{"product_id":"the-gem-slim-portable-juul-powerbank","title":"The GEM SLIM Portable JUUL Powerbank","description":"\u003cp\u003eNever worry about your JUUL running out of power again at the wrong time with the Juul GEM Slim Single Power Bank charger. This compact charger allows you to charge your JUUL up to three times when fully charged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GEM Slim is charged via a micro USB cable with LED indicator, letting you know when it is fully charged and ready to go. Whether you work outside all day or at a music festival, this is a must have for your JUUL. (JUUL sold separately)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSet complete set:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInternal battery 1000 mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicro USB cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"The GEM","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531771748407,"sku":"69d25d51c23e6","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/gem-slim-single-power-bank-juul-charger.jpg?v=1741710095","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/the-gem-slim-portable-juul-powerbank","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




